[38;5;252m[1m## What I found and fixed[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The translation was already close, but four real divergence classes came out of the differential testing — none of which happy-path tests would have caught:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1m1. Uninitialized [38;5;10mc2Proxy[0m on the poly path[22m (5,743 mismatches per 300k [38;5;10momni_manifold[0m calls). [38;5;10mc2MakeProxy[0m has no [38;5;10mC2_TYPE_POLY[0m case, so [38;5;10mc2GJK[0m's [38;5;10mc2Proxy pB[0m is never written — and I proved with [38;5;10mprobe[0m-style call-depth tests that the C's answer for [3midentical inputs[23m changes with the caller's stack contents. Not a translation defect, so I pinned it: [38;5;10mcommon::scrub_stack()[0m zero-fills 4 KiB below every FFI call, which forces the C's indeterminate proxy to the all-zeros state the Rust models. 5,743 → 0.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1m2. [38;5;10mverts[-1][0m read in [38;5;10mc2AABBtoCapsuleManifold[0m.[22m With a degenerate AABB every normal becomes [38;5;10mNaN[0m, [38;5;10mc2Incident[0m's [38;5;10mindex[0m stays [38;5;10m~0[0m, and the C evaluates [38;5;10mverts[-1][0m. [38;5;10mobjdump -d[0m shows gcc places [38;5;10mA.max.y[0m and [38;5;10mp.count[0m in those 8 bytes. [38;5;10msrc/lib.rs[0m now wraps the poly in [38;5;10m#[repr(C)] AabbCapsulePolyFrame { before_verts: f32, poly: c2Poly }[0m seeded with [38;5;10mA.max.y[0m, reproducing the read exactly.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1m3. NaN payload selection in commutative float ops.[22m [38;5;10maddss[0m/[38;5;10mmulss[0m return the [3mdestination[23m operand on a NaN tie, and gcc -O0 picks that register per expression in a way the C source doesn't express — in [38;5;10mc2Dot[0m the first product keeps its left operand in the destination and the second its right one. LLVM chose differently, so a caller passing Rust's [38;5;10mf32::NAN[0m ([38;5;10m0x7FC00000[0m) against the internally-generated [38;5;10m0xFFC00000[0m got different bits out. I read the destination off the disassembly at each of ~25 sites and pinned them with inline-asm helpers [38;5;10mfx::{add_l, add_r, mul_l, mul_r}[0m. Note: [38;5;10m_mm_add_ss[0m/[38;5;10m_mm_mul_ss[0m do [3mnot[23m work here — LLVM canonicalizes them back to plain [38;5;10mfadd[0m/[38;5;10mfmul[0m and reorders anyway.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1m4. Three Rust bounds checks that would abort where the C keeps going[22m: [38;5;10mc2Clip[0m's [38;5;10mout[2][0m write (reachable when [38;5;10md0 < 0 && d1 < 0[0m and their product underflows to [38;5;10m+0[0m), [38;5;10mpA.verts[iA][0m with a caller-supplied cache index, and [38;5;10msaveA[3][0m with a forged [38;5;10mcache->count >= 4[0m. All now use raw pointer arithmetic or over-sized/adjacent buffers. Under [38;5;10mpanic = "abort"[0m these were process kills.[0m[0m
